# Project: EM Second Brain

## What this project is
A Cursor prompt-driven automation tool that pulls data from Datadog and GitHub
to generate a daily engineering health dashboard and emails it via SMTP.

## Architecture rules
- Scripts live in `/scripts` — thin orchestration only
- All credentials come from `.env` via python-dotenv — never hardcode tokens or URLs
- Generated output (HTML, JSON) goes to `/output/` — always gitignored
- No hardcoded org/team names — everything configurable via env vars

## Scripts
- `scripts/datadog_dashboard_extract.py` — fetches Datadog dashboard metrics
- `scripts/github_prs.py` — fetches GitHub PR review queue
- `scripts/send_report_smtp.py` — sends HTML report via SMTP

## Output style
Use the `rich` library for terminal output. Color-coded:
- Red = needs attention
- Yellow = watch / trending wrong
- Green = healthy, no action needed
